      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}g(2)&=2^3+2-7\\\\g(2)&=3\\\\g^{-1}(3)&=2\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute $x=3$ into the given identity.\n$$\\begin{align*}f(2)&=f(g^{-1}(3))\\\\f(2)&=3^2\\\\f(2)&=9\\end{align*}$$",
